-- src:3380 | 18 The following applies in place of Schedule I:
-- src:3382 | SCHEDULE I (Subsection 12(2))
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule II para 18 (src:3380-3382)
GIVEN weeks IS A NUMBER
      rate IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `Schedule II para 18 the maximum number of weeks of benefit` IS
    CONSIDER `Schedule II para 18 the row for the weeks of insurable employment` weeks
    WHEN NOTHING   THEN NOTHING
    WHEN JUST row  THEN `ei6 the cell of the row in the column of` row (`the band of the regional rate of unemployment` rate)

-- Paragraph 18 applies in place of Schedule I from June 30, 1996 until Schedule I comes into force (s 190(3)(m), (4)).
-- src:3380 | 18 The following applies in place of Schedule I:
@ref Employment Insurance Act Schedule II para 18 (src:3380)
GIVEN day IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `Schedule II para 18 applies in place of Schedule I on the day` IF
    `s 190(4) Schedule II applies in place of the provision on the day` "Schedule I" day

